{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"She sees you and comes to thank you for your service.","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:30:47.696000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869104448474083368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"It's my pleasure to keep this place safe.\" The nameless replies with a smile. \"Say, Ferrah, do you know where I can get myself a tarot card deck? The ravens gave me the role of Speaker for the Dead and I want to be the best for that role and a deck would help a lot.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:37:34.932000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869106156545667102","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"She smiles at you. \"I happen to have one of my favorite decks on me, and I think it'll suit you more than I. A small thanks for your help this evening. If those rips had torn wider who knows what would've happened.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:41:00.196000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869107017485287524","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
