{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"https://www.etsy.com/listing/890230857/the-bone-tarot-deck-intuitive-divination?gpla=1&gao=1&&utm_source=google&utm_medium=cpc&utm_campaign=shopping_us_ps-b-home_and_living-spirituality_and_religion-divination_tools-other&utm_custom1=_k_EAIaIQobChMImpLd6JCA8gIVWyCtBh3ywA3sEAQYASABEgKlS_D_BwE_k_&utm_content=go_12566247314_121162390522_507253802110_pla-305373153576_m__890230857_129315353&utm_custom2=12566247314&gclid=EAIaIQobChMImpLd6JCA8gIVWyCtBh3ywA3sEAQYASABEgKlS_D_BwE","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:42:52.503000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869107488534970389","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Oh really?\" The nameless says surprised. \"I am grateful, I thought it'd be a bit harder to get me a deck.\" He says as he gets the deck. \"Do you know any spiritually active places here in Ferrytown I can go to meditate?\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:43:26.184000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869107629803319326","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"One only need look in the right place to find what they seek. And in my opinion this is the right place to seek a deck of fortune. This place is the best in my opinion, right below our great mother.\" She walks with you to the base of a massive, brightly colored tree. Then she pauses.  \"Or, if you want to connect with the dead more, I suppose <#852741576237121561>  is the place to go...\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:46:59.415000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-26T06:47:27.967000Z","id":"869108524158947348","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"I am the Speaker for the *Dead*. So I think I already know where I'm going.\" The nameless says as he pockets the deck. \"Thank you for the deck Ferrah, I'll be sure to put it to good use. If you need someone to help you in any thing spirit-wise, I'm here.\" He smiles as he leaves for <#852741576237121561>.","created_at":"2021-07-26T06:49:07.379000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869109060878860338","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
